    "title": "Extended WCL six-slot sparse squared-root divisor endpoints",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "Each of the six C1'-r3 widened WCL slots has an exact squared-root divisor form G=YA^2-B^2 or G=E^2-YB^2 dividing a 2-power cyclotomic polynomial. The six characteristic-zero schemes are unit ideals and have pruned cubic-or-lower straight-line presentations with 76--142 variables and 78--147 equations. Computing and factoring one nonzero integer certificate per slot remains open; no slot is closed.",
